  "description": "# SIP2.48: Add 2 Arks to LazyVault_LowerRisk_WETH Fleet on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 2 new Ark(s) to the existing LazyVault_LowerRisk_WETH Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional Arks will enhance the protocol's capabilities on mainnet.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0x67e536797570b3d8919Df052484273815A0aB506\n- Number of Arks to add: 2\n\n## New Ark Addresses\n1. `0x32B632D16710fA9dd121FD22052057F5A5e39CB7`\n2. `0xeaDBbFC3aD27a6CFE1e785598F4Ff6909DeC2D82`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for each Ark\n2. Add each Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://www.2.48.com\n",
